{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前古天樂（古仔）與旗下藝人陳苡臻（Jessica)合體拍片，原來Jessica請到老闆出面宣傳新歌《深情保養指引》，獲老闆出面打新歌。</p><p>短片開首是Jessica介紹古仔玩時下流行的新「成人玩具」，古仔大表好奇：「咁過癮？</p><p>」Jessica解釋</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:17:48.335045+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:01:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:11:06.209056+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:11:06.209056+00:00","content_hash":"18a27488555d33d789af2f3ff898e5f7535373be5f47b7bc013813c001334534","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}